        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `stream_platform_generation.py` that streams output from a managed model platform while preserving provider response objects, I need to select a concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in the code. I will use the Amazon Bedrock service for this task, as it is a well-known managed model platform. The code will import the necessary modules from the `boto3` library, which is the AWS SDK for Python, to interact with Amazon Bedrock. </thinking>\n",
